sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor PMS as PMS 外部流程平台
  participant FE as plant3d-web iframe
  participant Store as useReviewStore
  participant Records as /api/review/records
  participant Verify as /api/review/workflow/verify
  participant Sync as /api/review/workflow/sync
  participant DB as SurrealDB

  PMS->>FE: iframe 打开 embed-url<br/>form_id + user_token + role
  FE->>Store: 恢复 form_id 快照<br/>currentTask / records / attachments

  PMS->>FE: pms.workflow_pre_action<br/>{formId, action, requestId}
  FE->>Store: flushPendingConfirmForExternalAction(formId)
  alt 有未保存批注/测量
    Store->>Records: POST /api/review/records<br/>保存确认快照
    Records->>DB: CREATE review_records
    Records-->>Store: record_id
  else 无未保存数据
    Store-->>FE: saveOk=true
  end

  FE->>Verify: POST workflow/verify<br/>{form_id, token, action}
  Verify->>DB: 读取 review_tasks / review_records
  Verify-->>FE: passed / reason / recommended_action
  FE-->>PMS: plant3d.workflow_pre_action_acked

  alt PMS 决定继续推进
    PMS->>FE: pms.workflow_changed<br/>{formId, action, nextStep, comments}
    FE->>Sync: POST workflow/sync<br/>{form_id, actor, action, next_step, comments}
    Sync->>DB: UPDATE review_tasks / review_forms
    Sync->>DB: CREATE review_workflow_history
    Sync->>DB: SELECT form_id 聚合快照
    Sync-->>FE: SyncWorkflowResponse
    FE->>Store: 刷新 currentTask / records / history
    FE-->>PMS: plant3d.workflow_synced
  else PMS 阻止
    PMS-->>PMS: 停止外部流程动作
  end
